  "note": "From the Microsoft Support article \"Keyboard shortcuts in OneNote\", Windows and macOS tabs (the desktop OneNote tabs; the OneNote for Windows 10 / universal-app and web tabs of the same article are not included). Where Microsoft lists two equivalent bindings the first is kept. Omitted because the grammar cannot express them: mouse bindings, plain \"Arrow keys\" entries, numeric-keypad-only bindings, and open-ended entries such as \"type a page name, then press Enter\".",
